  "prefLabel": "Pes 306.06 Registration of Pesticides",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 306.06 Registration of Pesticides. All pesticides distributed, sold, held for sale or offered for sale in New Hampshire shall be registered with the New Hampshire department of agriculture, markets and food under RSA 430:36 - Pesticides Controls.\n\nSource. #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
